# state / artifacts
state.db
*.ramdb
# ...EXCEPT the golden byte-identity fixtures. `tests/core/test_ramdb_golden.py`
# compares against these four files and calls them the no-behaviour-change
# contract for customer-facing `.ramdb` output, so a failure there is
# release-blocking. The blanket rule above meant they were never committed and
# CI could not run that guard at all (red since 2026-08-14). ~1.9 KB total.
# The single `*` does not cross `/`, so generated output under
# tests/golden/ramdb/loading/ stays ignored.
!tests/golden/ramdb/*.ramdb
.r64-db-engine/

.DS_Store

